a PhD program in math and you made
a decision to do an MBA a year after that.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.210
Very validating for
all the MBAs here to hear.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.910
&gt;&gt; That's how we call it MPPM.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:01:02.630
I was telling people this is like MBA and,
often time, need a lot of explanations.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.120
Definitely.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:09.670
And you chose to go into banking
straight after your MBA.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.310
So I'm going to take us to the year 1999,

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:15.150
at this point you've been in banking for
eight years.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.750
You're running China capital markets for
